      "id": "file:helm/iedb-enterprise/templates/_helpers.tpl",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "_helpers.tpl",
      "filePath": "helm/iedb-enterprise/templates/_helpers.tpl",
      "summary": "Enterprise版Helm chart的模板辅助函数集合，通过define/end定义30个可复用命名模板，涵盖资源命名、Kubernetes标签生成、集群环境变量配置、存储模式分发、写入节点引导和调度配置。",
      "tags": ["helm", "kubernetes", "template", "helper"],
      "complexity": "complex",
      "languageNotes": "Helm命名模板通过define/end构建，支持跨模板调用（include）和字典参数传递（dict），是Kubernetes chart配置复用的核心模式。"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:helm/iedb-enterprise/templates/_validation.tpl",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "_validation.tpl",
      "filePath": "helm/iedb-enterprise/templates/_validation.tpl",
      "summary": "Enterprise版Helm chart的跨字段校验函数，在部署时验证写入节点副本数（禁止2副本以防Raft脑裂）、许可证密钥、共享密钥、TLS证书和MinIO/外部存储凭证等组合约束。",
      "tags": ["helm", "kubernetes", "validation", "security"],
      "complexity": "moderate",
      "languageNotes": "利用Helm的lookup函数在运行时查询现有Secret以支持chart升级场景，超越values.schema.json的静态类型校验能力。"
    },
