      "summary": "OSS版Helm chart的模板辅助函数，定义chart名称、完整应用名、标签和服务账户名称等6个基础命名模板。",
      "tags": ["helm", "kubernetes", "template", "helper"],
      "complexity": "simple"
    },
    {
      "id": "config:helm/iedb/values.yaml",
      "type": "config",
      "name": "values.yaml",
      "filePath": "helm/iedb/values.yaml",
      "summary": "OSS版Helm chart的默认配置值，定义副本数、Recreate更新策略（避免PVC死锁）、镜像拉取、安全上下文、ClusterIP服务、持久化存储（10Gi RWO PVC）和自动扩缩容参数。",
      "tags": ["helm", "kubernetes", "configuration", "deployment"],
      "complexity": "moderate",
      "languageNotes": "updateStrategy默认为Recreate以兼容ReadWriteOnce PVC —— RollingUpdate在单副本时因卷挂载时序问题导致死锁。"
    },
    {
      "id": "document:internal/ingest/flush_timing_analysis.md",
      "type": "document",
      "name": "flush_timing_analysis.md",
      "filePath": "internal/ingest/flush_timing_analysis.md",
      "summary": "Arrow写入缓冲区刷新时序分析文档，通过测试数据论证约5.1秒刷新延迟的原因（ticker调度抖动+锁竞争+操作耗时），分析用户报告的10秒问题的三种潜在场景。",
      "tags": ["documentation", "analysis", "performance", "ingest", "debugging"],
      "complexity": "simple"
    },
