      "id": "function:helm/iedb-enterprise/templates/_helpers.tpl:iedb-enterprise.commonClusterEnv",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "iedb-enterprise.commonClusterEnv",
      "filePath": "helm/iedb-enterprise/templates/_helpers.tpl",
      "lineRange": [220, 270],
      "summary": "定义Enterprise集群写入/读取/压缩节点共享的公共环境变量，包括节点ID、集群名称、协调器地址、共享密钥注入、许可证密钥、TLS证书路径和遥测控制。",
      "tags": ["helm", "environment", "cluster", "configuration"],
      "complexity": "moderate"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:helm/iedb-enterprise/templates/_helpers.tpl:iedb-enterprise.storageEnv",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "iedb-enterprise.storageEnv",
      "filePath": "helm/iedb-enterprise/templates/_helpers.tpl",
      "lineRange": [297, 345],
      "summary": "按存储模式（shared/local）渲染存储后端环境变量：共享模式下配置S3桶名、端点、凭证引用和关闭复制；本地模式下配置本地路径、启用节点间复制及拉取参数。",
      "tags": ["helm", "storage", "environment", "configuration"],
      "complexity": "moderate"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:helm/iedb-enterprise/templates/_helpers.tpl:iedb-enterprise.writerSeeds",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "iedb-enterprise.writerSeeds",
      "filePath": "helm/iedb-enterprise/templates/_helpers.tpl",
      "lineRange": [351, 361],
      "summary": "通过headless service的DNS名称遍历生成所有写入Pod的种子列表，用于读取节点和压缩节点的Raft集群自动发现。",
      "tags": ["helm", "cluster", "discovery", "dns"],
      "complexity": "simple"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:helm/iedb-enterprise/templates/_helpers.tpl:iedb-enterprise.writerEntrypoint",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "iedb-enterprise.writerEntrypoint",
      "filePath": "helm/iedb-enterprise/templates/_helpers.tpl",
      "lineRange": [370, 379],
      "summary": "生成写入节点自定义启动命令，通过shell脚本根据POD_NAME后缀是否以-0结尾动态设置Raft引导标志，确保StatefulSet中仅第一个Pod初始化Raft集群。",
      "tags": ["helm", "cluster", "raft", "bootstrap"],
      "complexity": "simple",
      "languageNotes": "由于StatefulSet环境变量在chart渲染时静态生成，无法按Pod序号差异化设置，因此通过shell包装层基于POD_NAME动态判断。exec保留信号转发到主进程。"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:helm/iedb-enterprise/templates/_helpers.tpl:iedb-enterprise.roleScheduling",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "iedb-enterprise.roleScheduling",
      "filePath": "helm/iedb-enterprise/templates/_helpers.tpl",
      "lineRange": [196, 213],
      "summary": "渲染角色特定的Kubernetes调度配置（nodeSelector、tolerations、affinity），支持回退到全局顶层值，通过dict传递ctx和role参数。",
      "tags": ["helm", "scheduling", "kubernetes"],
      "complexity": "simple"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:helm/iedb-enterprise/templates/_helpers.tpl:iedb-enterprise.writerWalEnv",
