      "name": "iedb-enterprise.writerWalEnv",
      "filePath": "helm/iedb-enterprise/templates/_helpers.tpl",
      "lineRange": [283, 292],
      "summary": "定义写入节点的WAL（Write-Ahead Log）环境变量，控制WAL启用状态、数据目录路径和同步模式，由writer.wal.enabled配置控制。",
      "tags": ["helm", "wal", "durability", "environment"],
      "complexity": "simple"
    },
    {
